# text = On behalf of the Conservative Party someone whom I think we all respect for his moral rectitude , Lord Hugh Cecil — Lord Quickswood as he now is — put down a Motion on behalf of the Conservative Party saying — I have not the exact words with me — that the right of the common informer must come first .
