# text_id = 1589
# text = As was indicated in the Communiqué which was issued after my talks in Washington on 9th January , neither we nor the United States consider it wise to take the important step of changing our rifles at the present time , and we shall both continue to rely upon rifles and ammunition which are now in stock or are being produced .
