# text = It appears to me that the last thing which your Lordships would wish to do is to encourage a purely artificial arrangement , offered openly by the clauses of the Bill to anybody who chooses to take advantage of it , that he can satisfy the conditions of the Bill by arranging to reside just before his lease normally runs out .
