# text_id = 1597
# text = The most charitable thing that I can say is that I assume that the views which have been expressed by my hon . Friend the Member for Newcastle - under - Lyme ( Mr. Swingler ) , and the hon . Member for Aston ( Mr. Wyatt ) earlier , are based upon a mistaken appreciation of the facts .
