# text = I also remember , before the war , when slum clearance was at its height in Leeds , the Rev. Charles Jenkinson , then Chairman of the Housing Committee , whose untimely death was mourned by political friend and foe alike , announcing that for each new house built in the City of Leeds , a tree would also toe planted .
