# text_id = 1620
# text = Lastly , of course , we could have manipulated the White Nile waters , which would , in course of time , have starved the people of Egypt ; but I am perfectly certain that the conscience of the whole nation would have been so afflicted by that thought that any Government contemplating it would have had to drop the idea .
