# text_id = 1621
# text = We are confronted to - day with the sad circumstance that , in spite of the work of the Alness Committee , and of the subsequent Committee in 1947 , we are back to where we were thirteen years ago , with the same number of killed and injured — 6,000 killed , and 200,000 injured — on the roads .
