# text_id = 1629
# text = The United Kingdom Government , recognising the traditional nature of the trade relations between Denmark and the United Kingdom , did not intend to adopt policies likely to deny Danish producers the opportunity to maintain their market in the United Kingdom for commodities of concern to them or to share in any increase in the United Kingdom market for those products .
