# text_id = 1632
# text = As my hon . Friend said , there is a general shortage of teachers throughout Scotland , and as he developed his argument it seemed to me to be clear that , as things stand just now , unless some sort of further provision is made , we shall aggravate that shortage of teachers , certainly of the male sex .
