# text = From my experience in the war , under very arduous conditions , such as Russian convoys , when we had carriers operating inside the destroyer screen in extraordinarily hazardous conditions , the service that they gave to the convoy could not have been beaten by anybody , and we had the advantage of having them with us all the time .
