# text_id = 1650
# text = It may be there are differences in the cotton trade with regard to the finishing of grey cloth , but I cannot see why , if grey cloth is brought to this country to be finished in order to keep the finishers at work , they can not be equally kept at work if the cloth is manufactured in this country .
