# text_id = 1685
# text = The noble Earl , Lord Wavell , has given the greatest justification for further education , to which the noble Viscount , Lord Caldecote , tried to apply a cold douche , because it is when a boy reaches the age of sixteen or seventeen that he realises what education is , rather than when he was three or five .
