# text_id = 1688
# text = As most of your Lordships are probably aware , one of the results of the increase of mechanisation in the mines is that we get less of the larger coal which we have been accustomed to burn in open grates in our homes for so many years , and shall have to use a larger proportion of the smaller sizes .
