# text_id = 1689
# text = The number of shale miners has been reduced by two - thirds but , on the other hand , it should not be forgotten that as a result of the expansion at the Grangemouth refineries , as a result of this Scottish co-operation with British Petroleum , a very large amount of employment is found for people engaged in the refineries .
