# text = There are considerable practical difficulties in the way of Sunday afternoon opening , and while these can be faced during the summer months when attendances throughout the week are very heavy , I do not feel that I should be justified in continuing the necessary arrangements during the winter when daily attendances drop very steeply and the days are short .
