# text_id = 1730
# text = I propose , therefore , to introduce an overnight service , under which telegrams other than Greetings telegrams will be accepted at any time up to 10 p.m. for delivery early next morning , normally by first post , at the present standard charge of 1s . 6d . for twelve words , and 1½d. for each additional word .
