# text_id = 1741
# text = It was because of the concern that grew up after 1953 about the impact on industry generally , and the losses that were then incurred as a result of changes in this tax , that representations were made to the Chancellor that , whenever possible , Purchase Tax changes should take place when stocks wer normally at a low level .
