# text = While appreciating that , may I ask the right hon . and learned Gentleman to take the next opportunity , when discussions are taking place with representatives of the Greek Government , even on economic matters , to intimate that those discussions would be welcomed far more widely in this country if the Greek Government released the remaining political prisoners ?
