# text_id = 1767
# text = I would say , in conclusion , that the greatest challenge to our achievements to - clay is the fact that we still persist , with complacency , in assessing what we are doing as against what has been done , rather than accepting ourselves — as we must — the challenge of comparison with what could be done .
