# text_id = 1770
# text = Also I think your Lordships would agree that we could make only one universal law , and it would seem to be rather ridiculous to make pedestrians honour traffic lights in the middle of the night , when there is no traffic about , or in the country where there are traffic lights but no traffic in certain hours .
