# text_id = 1771
# text = We had the rushed and hurried visit to this country of Mr. Dulles , who expressed the belief — and I must confess that it was also my belief at the time — that the Foreign Secretary had agreed to a policy of united action and the setting up of an Asian N.A.T.O. before the beginning of the Geneva Conference .
