# text_id = 1772
# text = No one admires the Royal Navy more than I do , but I think Coastal Command should remain in the R.A.F . Coastal Command is vitally important for our protection against U - boats , but we should have today , if we are to be secure , something like six operational aircraft for every possible enemy U - boat .
