# text_id = 1773
# text = Logically , it is difficult to justify this sort of subsidy on one of the factors in the means of production , but men — farmers are not excluded from this category — are neither wholly rational nor logical beings , and I regard this subsidy as doing something to encourage the increase in productivity that we so much want .
