# text_id = 1774
# text = I do not want to misrepresent the hon . and gallant Gentleman , who often speaks with courage and sincerity in our debates , but I think I am in the recollection of the Committee in saying that while condemning the Chancellor for introducing the Budget , the hon . and gallant Gentleman applauds his obstinacy in refusing to amend it .
