# text = The hon . Member for Fulham , East ( Mr. M. Stewart ) made a good many criticisms about the scheme , and , among other things , he entirely rejected the arguments concerning the necessity for the scheme or the possibly smaller proportions in which the scheme would have been necessary had the Army thrived more between 1945 and 1950 .
