# text_id = 1781
# text = As I explained on 24th April in reply to my hon . Friend the Member for Kidderminster ( Mr. Nabarro ) , the applications referred to in the memorandum are still being investigated by the United States Tariff Commission who have not yet made any recommendations on any of them ; accordingly , the question of action under Article XIX of the General Agreement does not at present arise .
