# text = If we compare like with like and take reliable figures , such as those provided by the Grocer — in other words , figures comparable with those which I gave the House in March — we find that back rashers , the maximum price of which under a Labour Government was 3s . per lb. , in March cost 3s . 10d. per lb. , as I then told the House .
