# text_id = 1788
# text = Many entirely legitimate institutions in the City have grumbled that they are not benefiting from the exemption being granted to stock jobbers and to discount houses , but the general consensus of opinion which I have been able to obtain is that these transactions , which are themselves undesirable must , in the national interest , be dealt with so as to be controlled in the most limited number of cases .
