# text_id = 1790
# text = That is one of the many answers to right hon . and hon . Gentlemen opposite who say that we have allowed production to decline , when they know perfectly well that we inherited , in the textile industry and elsewhere , a situation of declining production which , largely by our own efforts , aided by the more sensible members of the committee , we were able to restore .
