# text_id = 1795
# text = The purpose of this Amending Order , which , if your Lordships approve this Motion , will come into operation on January 1 , 1954 , is therefore to advance the base year from 1951 to 1952 , and to establish new rates of charge to ensure that the income from the levy remains approximately the same as before ; that is to say , at £ 15,000 a year .
