# text_id = 1796
# text = I can assure the noble Earl that far from being a siding , the Ministry of Defence is performing the functions for which it is designed extremely well , and although there have been three Ministers in the last eighteen months , which may make it difficult to attack them individually , their policies have not been individual policies but the coherent policy of the Government as a whole .
