# text = I am particularly happy , as I am by profession a journalist , that it should fall to me to follow the hon . Lady the Member for Coatbridge and Airdrie ( Mrs. Mann ) who has just made her farewell speech , because one of the many characteristics of her speeches , which both sides of the House have always enjoyed , is her infallible instinct for the headlines .
