# text = In their fight for the return of the facilities which the Housing ( Rural Workers ) Act provided , the Tories and the farmers , whose arguments will not hold water , claim that a farmer who availed himself of a grant under the recent Housing Acts lost control of the house so that a worker could take other employment and still remain in the house as long as he liked .
