# text_id = 1801
# text = I should like to add to what was said by my hon . Friend the Member for Carlton ( Mr. Pickthorn ) , because so often in these days we find we are passing merely enabling Bills — Bills in which we are not making the final decision ourselves , as the public generally expect us to do , but are giving the power to somebody else to make it .
