# text_id = 1803
# text = In a way , the value and virtue of this Bill have been obscured , both on the Second Reading and in Committee , by the battle fought on behalf of the freedom of the Press and the freedom of literature , which several of my hon . Friends , particularly the hon . Members for Stechford ( Mr. Roy Jenkins ) and Devonport ( Mr. Foot ) have fought .
