# text_id = 1804
# text = I will certainly consider whether , for instance , by the insertion of the word " pamphlet " or " circular " the definition in line 5 of the Bill could be expanded , without at the same time making the character of the Bill so extensive that something other than the horror comic could be brought within its scope , because that is not what one wants to do .
