# text_id = 1805
# text = I should like to see peace pursued with a new devotion to the task of discovering the causes of war , with a new devotion to approach every problem with the yardstick of justice by which to measure every situation ; and I would wish to see it approached with a new appreciation of the importance of spiritual values and not solely concentrating upon the material things that cause war .
