# text_id = 1809
# text = In fact , we shall before long , quite possibly , have a situation where a burglar enters a house and commits an ordinary theft , that offence being followed , perhaps in the same town the next day , by a murder , both of those offences being subject to sentences of terms of imprisonment , the one being merely an extension of the sentence passed for the other .
