# text = If we are to depart from the principle of registration , which is implicit in so much of the legislation dealing with standards of marketing , the conduct of food premises , the manufacturing industries , and so on ; if we depart from that principle in regard to catering , there may be requests for departure from registration in some of those other industries where registration has been so successful .
