# text_id = 1812
# text = I wish to detain the Committee for only a short time , and I do so because there is a small textile industry in my constituency and also , as has been said by the hon . Lady the Member for Blackburn , East ( Mrs. Castle ) , because this is a matter of widespread interest , as the tax imposed under this Clause will affect a great many people .
