# text_id = 1814
# text = I do not know whether my hon . and learned Friend the Member for Northampton ( Mr. Paget ) is right or not , but I am certain of one thing , and that is that if the United States are faced with having Armed Forces of Her Majesty serving in that country and do not quickly pass a Measure similar to this , they will be extremely stupid .
