# text_id = 1815
# text = We must be prepared to pay them still more if , in my part of the world , the workers on the land are to remain at their jobs in an area in which there are the great car factories of Coventry and other industries in the Midlands offering well paid jobs and calling men off the land into the towns like Coventry , Leamington , Nuneaton , and so forth .
