# text = Will the noble Viscount also look into the question which has been raised , namely , of protecting the kingfisher in some way — I am not prepared to say what way — in particular parts of the country where it can do no harm at all , and perhaps , where it is doing harm to fisheries or in other directions , raising its protection under some kind of licence ?
