# text = Moreover , one has to take into account that the one possible practical effect on the revenue might be that people who were promoting something which was not really an eisteddfod would seek to miscall it an eisteddfod to try to convince the Customs that something which ought to be taxed , because it was not an eisteddfod , should be exempt from tax , because it was an eisteddfod .
