# text = However , I conceived the main importance of my job to be the solving of the long - term problem — not merely the international materials conference problem , and so on , but the long - term problem of this comprehensive survey , introduced as a result of the initiative of President Truman which showed that there would be a 15 per cent . overall shortage in 1975 .
