# text = For even the vilest sinner there is always the lamp of mercy burning , and for the Secretary of State the lamp of mercy still burns , and he can return to grace , because he can tell us that , recognising that he has withdrawn from us certain rights , he will agree that these Lords Amendments should be remitted to the Scottish Standing Committee to be dealt with there .
