# text = I think that he claims , and it has been claimed by others in the course of this debate , that the fixing of D levels for gloves was , first of all , not done on sufficient evidence and , secondly , it has been so fixed that there is not an adequate proportion outside and below the D level of popular prices which will be free from tax .
