# text = May I submit to you , Sir , that the alteration of the word " sabotage " to the word " impede " makes no difference whatever , and that the charge was quite clearly one that hon . Members on this side of the House had set to work in order to render abortive an Act of Parliament passed by this House and now the law of the land ?
