# text = Comments have been made by the hon . Member for Aston ( Mr. Wyatt ) , the hon . Member for Preston , South ( Mr. Shackle - ton ) and my hon . Friend the Member for Exeter ( Mr. Dudley Williams ) which perhaps were not intended that way , but which I thought were likely to cause a certain amount of ill - feeling between the Services .
