# text = I am sure that the experience of the recent year or two in our big hospitals shows that that is absolutely correct , but I hope that when we consider this matter we shall not forget the many small maternity units in the rural areas , which are playing an equal if not bigger part in the global picture , because the production of domestic staff will not help them .
