# text_id = 1828
# text = What I regret is that it seems to me that the Government have taken hasty decisions and selected two places in the service to slap on a charge in what seems to me to be a Bill put forward by the Chancellor of the Exchequer rather than out of a steady desire , if charges must be made , so to apply them as to secure the best possible service .
