# text_id = 1829
# text = At present the rent of a house of the same type costing the same amount of money , because of the increase of charges and because of the taking away of the Exchequer subsidy has jumped from £ 1 5s. 2d. to £ 3 8s. 3d. ; in other words , over £ 2 3 s . per week , as a result of the financial policies of the Government .
