# text = The provision of buildings , the provision of equipment , the surveying of localities , the laying of cables , the training of staff are all jobs which necessarily take up much time when any big developments are under way , and I am myself inclined to the view that there is need for the Post Office to be granted even longer security in which to lay its development plans .
