# text_id = 1833
# text = It is said that , at a time when charges and circumstances are changing and when it is necessary to adjust charges to customers , that piece of clumsy and longwinded procedure handicaps a corporate body in having to observe conditions , which were framed in totally different days , in a condition of monopoly in which it had to ensure that preferential treatment was not given to customers .
