# text_id = 1834
# text = Even if it is not making profits today , — and that I doubt — British Road Services is still providing a remarkable service , and its staff and the workers deserve great credit for the fact that the organisation is carrying on and providing such a good service in the light of the known fact that by the end of next year it is to be disintegrated and destroyed .
