# text_id = 1835
# text = In justification of that , I would mention that the tax raised on commercal vehicle chassis has amounted to no less than £ 69·1 million over seven years since it was imposed in 1950 , and while the yield in the first full year , 1950 –1 , was at the modest rate of £ 4·1 million , it has now become £ 12½1 million in a full year .
