# text = I should like to associate myself with what my right hon . Friend the Member for Colne Valley ( Mr. Glenvil Hall ) has said about this Bill , and with the congratulations that he has offered to the hon . Member for Crosby ( Mr. Page ) , who has introduced it successfully so far and will , we hope , see that it gets on to the Statute Book .
