# text_id = 1843
# text = It is very difficult to see clearly the end , hut whether it will be the happy ending or a sad ending will depend very largely , not on the amount of the contribution that Britain makes to the defence of Europe , but on the part which she plays and the lead which she Gives in the political , economic and social life of Europe during the coming years .
