# text_id = 1846
# text = May I start by echoing the tribute paid by my right hon . Friend to his predecessor , who will , I believe , go down in history as one of the greatest of our Colonial Secretaries — perhaps , because he had immense problems to tackle and was not altogether helped by modern means of communication and transportation , he may even go down in history as the greatest .
