# text_id = 1847
# text = As this is rather a solemn meeting — I might almost call it an eve- of - the - poll meeting — I do not propose either to join in the problems of the party opposite , which would be quite out of place , or to distribute the largesse in compliments which is usual , for fear , perhaps , of being slightly unfair to one candidate or the other .
