# text_id = 1848
# text = In answer to the various points raised , some of which are points of order and some points of debate , I would only say that so far as I recollect — and I have been in the Chair all the time that this debate has gone on , both today and the previous day — nothing has been said which I consider sufficiently out of order to interrupt or reject .
