# text_id = 1850
# text = From the local authority point of view , this is a very serious retrogression which will cause the local authorities considerable anxiety , and we must remember that it is in respect of a new function , a function which I shall come to describe later , tout a function of taking over slum property from the slum landlords because they themselves do not know what to do with it .
