# text_id = 1853
# text = Since the 2 per cent . increase in the world production of food outside Russia is only about equal to the increase in the world population , can my right hon . and gallant Friend make it abundantly clear to the people of this country that there is a great danger that we shall not get as much food in the future as we have had in the past ?
