# text_id = 1854
# text = I think that the President was quite right in not coming forward with his suggestions as to how this problem should be tackled in detail ; but , as a result of this debate , I am sure that the President will be able to discuss the substance of the matter with other Members of the Government and then come forward with proposals for getting over the present textile troubles .
