# text = I do not suppose it has escaped the attention of the right hon . and gallant Gentleman , and I am sure that he will remind the House of it , that if every single exception and Amendment proposed in Committee had been accepted by the Committee and was now in the Bill , the incidents and crimes to which he has just referred would still not have been covered .
