# text = At any rate , it is a tax - free additional item of revenue for private profit - making business which in the end — I should like the Chancellor to confirm this — must cost the Exchequer £ 60 million or perhaps even £ 100 million a year , and will go largely to firms the great bulk of whom would have made the investment in any case .
