# text_id = 1858
# text = This may seem a very small problem compared with the great and varied problems we have already considered this afternoon , but it is by no means a small problem to the German women concerned , and it is a matter of some injustice which has continued for several years , and which , I think , has done a certain amount of harm to our relations with the German people .
