# text_id = 1860
# text = The reason the Act has not so far had to be amended , and why many of these things have been added to the 1909 Measure without any outcry on the part of anyone , has been , I think , due largely to the fact that cinema proprietors have realised that , unless they conformed to the conditions laid down , they might not get a renewal of their licences .
