# text = But I should like to ask the Chancellor why , having taken that step , which costs exactly the same as the scheme which I have for some time been urging upon him , he cannot take the further step of endorsing post - war credits with the date at which their owner becomes 60 or 65 years old promising to redeem on that date so that they become negotiable .
