# text_id = 1863
# text = The noble Lord gave the reasons stated in the White Paper and I did not expect him to do otherwise ; but when one comes to look at these reasons and see why the Government are throwing the whole of the problem into the melting pot once more — because that is what they are doing — one cannot help feeling that the reasons are singularly inadequate and certainly uncompelling .
