# text_id = 1868
# text = The point that I want to put forward this evening is that , at the present moment , whilst fighting our wages inflation , if we are to keep up our investments and cure inflation , it can only come now from spending less on the part of the Government , from decreasing taxation and seeing that these savings are taken up for investment in the private sector of the economy .
