# text_id = 1869
# text = It is my earnest desire that this industry in the future , as at present , will continue to give the maximum help , without any undue spirit of partisanship , to the Parliamentary Secretary and even to the boards of the corporations in the very difficult task they have of ensuring that the British aircraft industry is an expanding one , a safe one and a successful one .
