# text_id = 1870
# text = Again , without trying to be provocative , I say that this type of property varies in age and character and in its standard of maintenance , and that comparison between these 5 million properties below the rateable value limits of £ 40 and £ 30 and the 810,000 houses is not possible because conditions which might obtain in one case are not likely to obtain in the other .
