# text = Such a thing shocks people very much , but it is merely a truthful indication of the fact that we spend many hours in the House waiting for the Division bell to go to decide a question about which we have no knowledge whatever and on which we have to rely on the judgment of our hon . Friends , whose opinions we have , from experience , come to respect .
