# text_id = 1875
# text = It is a short non-controversial Bill , but none the less it is one of very great constitutional importance , and I agree so much with what my hon . Friend the Member for Bucks , South ( Mr. Bell ) has just said , namely , that where there is a proposal to extend diplomatic privilege and immunity it must have the most careful consideration by this House .
