# text_id = 1876
# text = So it is no use chirruping about the fact that the record shows only 19,000 people unemployed in Wales because , the rest of our normal unemployed migrated to England long ago , and that process is going on all the time , so let us not be too cheerful about the bare figures of unemployment because , behind those figures , lies a story of continuous and depressing migration .
