# text = Not the least of our economic assets in the battle to improve our financial and economic position in the very difficult post - war world into which we have been catapulted by a war which drastically changed the economic situation has been the fact that the country has a trade union movement which is more responsible , more patriotic and more intelligent than any comparable working class in the world .
