# text = As I think I said on Second Reading — but I should like to clarify it if I did not make this matter clear — the provision in the Bill replaces earlier similar provisions of Section 54 of the Metropolitan Police Act , 1839 , and Section 28 of the Town Police Clauses Act , 1847 , and reproduces what is believed to he the effect of those provisions .
