# text_id = 1893
# text = I am certain , and I think it is well known to the hon . Member for Wednesbury , that this subsidy of £ 10 million to relieve the farmer of part of the increased cost of phosphatic fertilisers will be taken fully into account at the Annual Price Review and we shall get correspondingly less than we should otherwise receive for potatoes , wheat , barley and other crops .
