# text_id = 1894
# text = The hon . Member very generously said that he had not given notice of the other case he mentioned and , therefore , I could not be expected to answer tonight , but I met him briefly this afternoon and he told me that he had a case from Oxfordshire and I have been able to make a brief investigation and am able to add a little to what he said .
