# text_id = 1897
# text = Her Majesty 's Government cannot but be affected by that hardship and that distress ; and if the exigencies of the negotiations result in added hardship , as they must do if there is delay , as there has been delay through , as I would say , no fault of ours , obviously Her Majesty 's Government must take that into account and would wish to do so .
