# text_id = 1899
# text = The hon . Member for Flint , West ( Mr. Birch ) , went as far back as the days of Florence Nightingale and used the illustration of the life of that lady as proof of the utter irresponsibility of Government Departments , and even of Governments , in the face of terrible social tragedies , and of the failure of such Governments and Departments to face up to those responsibilities .
