# text_id = 1902
# text = My wish would be that consultation should take place with the county and county district councils which have the new towns within their areas , and that , in addition , the Minister should appoint a number of people who have intimate knowledge of local government affairs and , in particular , of the local government problems that confront the new areas that have been developed under the Act .
