# text = But I have no reason to believe that the nursing service has ever been afraid of taking that responsibility , and I would ask my right hon . Friend to realise that he must compensate for the fact that if they go to these small units these people will be living in country districts where they will be strangers , and where the opportunity for promotion will not exist .
