# text_id = 1905
# text = I would even go further and would say that under present world conditions we can more acceptably play our part in our relationship with our great partners overseas , and with the Colonial Empire also , if we have succeeded in jointly rebuilding the political and economic life of Western Europe , and in giving to these areas a measure of prosperity and stability and a true feeling of lasting security .
