# text_id = 1906
# text = It is obvious that a reduction in the supply of this material will have its effect , particularly on the luxury lines and novelties in the biscuit field , but my right hon . Friend is assured by the trade that they will do their utmost to minimise the effect on the output of biscuits , and my right hon . Friend is not prepared to re-introduce the points system .
