# text = But as I understand the speech of the hon . Gentleman — and here I should like to congratulate him upon the brevity with which he presented the Bill — the main purpose which he has in mind is to ensure that streets are made up expeditiously and that they do not remain in an unmade condition for an undue space of time before the local authority comes on the scene .
