# text_id = 1908
# text = It is only this year , owing to the wording of the Money Resolution by the Government which — I hesitate to say this — might be considered by some to be a little sharp in the way of Parliamentary practice , that we are unable to put down , as many of us on both sides of the Committee would desire , Amendments to reduce Purchase Tax on many items .
