# text = In other words , is it better to do it when there is a great desire on the part of Singapore to do it , or should they wait until Singapore itself may be in a hostile and sullen mood because the economic policies followed by the mainland of Malaya have prevented the people there from living their lives as they wish to and created a great deal of unemployment ?
