# text_id = 1912
# text = I remember , I think accurately , an hon . Member opposite examining one of the Maltese trade union officials upon the point , suggesting that the Trades Union Congress might have something to say on that , that the Trades Union Congress might take very seriously the integration into our economy of a population , even though of only 80,000 workers , whose sole industrial asset was low wages .
