# text_id = 1915
# text = We are being asked to consider all these changes to a complex Bill at this late hour tonight , despite the fact that , on the Report stage , the Secretary of State for Scotland , a man of great ability , told us that the reason why he had not taken any part in that debate was because he had had considerable difficulty in mastering all the points .
