# text_id = 1916
# text = We are fully alive to the second danger because the Soviet Union has been pursuing this aim for a long time ; but the danger of Soviet designs in the Middle East — some of them traditional Russian ambitions — has not made the same sharp impact on the public mind , perhaps because the threat has been latent rather than active , and the scene is much further away .
