# text_id = 1921
# text = I remember that on a visit to the United States in the autumn of last year I saw much publicity given in the Press to matter from official naval productions , and it was particularly directed to what was called the gigantic atomic - powered submarine of the future , one of which , we were told , is now being built , while designs were being prepared for another .
