# text = It is because of that that I want to underline the truth that was enshrined in the speech of my noble friend Lord Balfour of Inchrye when he spoke of a reborn determination to secure the object for which we struggle ; and he emphasised — and I would say at once rightly emphasised — the essential rôle of Government in this matter when he emphasised their responsibility for leadership .
