# text = We say that the Under - Secretary has admitted that there was nothing wrong in his approaching Sir Roy Welensky for an undertaking of the right of access for an hon . Member of this House , but that he is not prepared , and was not prepared , to do it on behalf of my hon . Friend the Member for Wednesbury ( Mr. Stone - house ) .
