# text = When a Bill of this kind , which so vitally affects the interest rate to be paid by local authorities , has to be considered , we in Scotland are especially interested , because , if there is one problem with which I have been concerned for many long years with local authorities , it is the question of the interest rates charged by the Public Works Loans Board .
