# text = We had quite a long conversation about this job , and he asked me , as I could not recommend him a situation immediately , to write to the governor if I heard of anything within the next few weeks — his sentence does not expire until July — and the governor would be very pleased to arrange for him to come to London and interview the prospective employer .
