# text_id = 1929
# text = At the present time both the major parties in Singapore want a close alliance with the mainland of Malaya and , although they are led by Chinese , both the major parties in Singapore , the P.A.P. and the party led by Mr. Lim Yew Hock , the present Chief Minister , are both anxious to subordinate their Chinese characteristics to the necessity of maintaining the closest alliance with Malaya itself .
