# text_id = 1931
# text = My hon . Friend the Parliamentary Secretary to the Ministry of Education used the word frequently , though I am not quite sure that I accept his adjective , when he said the whole point was that this was really a constitutional problem , that major matters such as nationalisation and denationalisation which affect everybody in the country should of right and necessity be discussed on the Floor of the House .
