# text_id = 1933
# text = So , my Lords , I say that the part of the Agreement dealing with the restoration of public rights is all to the good — the part that terminates restrictions on British nationals ; that allows them to do business once more ; to enter into contracts ; to go to Egypt and to leave Egypt when they want to ; and to reside there if they so wish .
