# text_id = 1935
# text = The removal of paragraph ( b ) will mean that , in all these cases in which the county council refuses access to a newly - constructed by - pass , the owner of the adjacent land , who has done nothing to create the extra value of the land through which the by - pass runs , will be entitled to compensation because the county council refuses access to it .
