# text = I also adjusted the scale at the upper end to bring in a total of £ 22 million more revenue in that year , although I was able to exempt by raising the exemption level from £ 100 to £ 2,000 — this illustrates another point that I wish to elaborate in a moment — no fewer than 75 per cent . of the estates which would otherwise have been liable .
