# text_id = 1943
# text = Like my right hon . Friend and the right hon . Gentleman the Member for Greenock ( Mr. McNeil ) , I am sure that the whole of this Committee is very grateful to the hon . Member for Newcastle - upon - Tyne , East ( Mr. Blenkinsop ) for the manner in which he opened this debate and for the very high tone that his speech set for it .
