# text_id = 1948
# text = In view of the fact that 40,000 Jamaicans are expected in the country this year , and as the principle of " last in , first out " will be applied , irrespective of colour , ought not the Colonial Secretary to see that this warning for which the hon . Member for Eton and Slough ( Mr. Fenner Brockway ) asked , is sounded very well and truly in Jamaica ?
