# text_id = 1950
# text = Mr. Teeling asked the President of the Board of Trade if he is aware that the pleasure steamer company on the South Coast have announced the impending closing down of their pleasure cruise services ; and whether he will consult the Home Office and other Departments concerned with a view to keeping the service running by the relaxation of the present passport requirements which hinder day cruises to continental coastal towns .
