# text = I can only speak for myself , but I think it would be reasonable to differentiate between the part - time member who occasionally sits and does so out of a motive to help in a public service with very little remuneration to himself on the one hand , and the person who is fully and wholly employed as a chairman or president of a tribunal on the other .
