# text = I am sorry if I seem unduly suspicious , but I hope that the Secretary of State will be able to tell us to - day that that is not merely a transitional arrangement , pending legislation — the Secretary of State shakes his head , so I need go no further , because a shake of the head from him is equivalent to a long speech from some people .
