# text = Mr. Coldrick asked the Minister of Agriculture , Fisheries and Food if he is aware that Majestic potatoes cost £ 17 per ton last year when prices were Government - controlled , compared with £ 40 per ton at present ; and if he will therefore take steps to see that there is more consumer representation on the producer - controlled Potato Marketing Board to prevent the community from being overcharged .
