# text_id = 1966
# text = Surely on a par with that , what I have just been saying is equally important under present demands ; that is , the wellbeing of our manhood , with the added physique and stamina , the understanding of discipline and the increased self - confidence that National Service has obviously given to a great number of young men , as well as a wider knowledge of their fellow beings .
