# text_id = 1967
# text = If he could implant in the minds of the jury a reasonable doubt as to whether he is innocent or guilty , he would go away scot - free , and in my submission it would be necessary for a judge in summing up the case to the jury to put that point to the jury and to say that that is what the accused man has to do .
