# text_id = 1968
# text = Last summer the Argentine thought that they could get more and they started negotiations , and they began them by asking for £ 140 , but — and this is a very important " but " — and I take all this from information given by the Chancellor of the Exchequer on 8th February — they were prepared to go on receiving £ 97 10s . pending an Agreement .
